<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major></Major>
    <Description>Wallboost macro for Parkour Modded(950x)

Mouse/Camera sensitivity should be 0.84 or higher.
Screen Resolution: 1366 x768

Set at 90ms by default.
Going lower could result it you being detected and your save data being wiped.

If on the ground just make sure you're against the wall and look straight at the wall or straight up in line with the wall.

If you are in the air make sure you're against the wall and alligned with the wall as straight as possible; if used after a magrail dash/grappledash, if you have thruster equipped you have to use it before you can perform a wall climb boost.

It may take you a few tries to get used to doing it in the air, if you have secondary mouse buttons I'd suggest macroing it to those.</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>KeyDown 44 1
Delay 20 ms
KeyUp 44 1
MoveR -1253 -1153
Delay 90 ms
KeyDown 44 1
KeyUp 44 1</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Roblox</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>